### Common Issues

1. **Pod startup failures**:

   ```bash
   kubectl logs -f deployment/eap-mkdocs-platform -n eap-platform-{env}
   kubectl describe pod <pod-name> -n eap-platform-{env}
   ```

2. **Service connectivity**:

   ```bash
   kubectl get svc -n eap-platform-{env}
   kubectl get ingress -n eap-platform-{env}
   ```

3. **Resource constraints**:

   ```bash
   kubectl top pods -n eap-platform-{env}
   kubectl describe hpa eap-mkdocs-platform-hpa -n eap-platform-{env}
   ```

