[.tooling/components/apps/mkdocs-platform/k8s/README.md#health-check-commands]

### Health Check Commands

```bash
# Check deployment status
kubectl get deployments -n eap-platform-{env}

# Check pod health
kubectl get pods -n eap-platform-{env}

# Check service endpoints
kubectl get endpoints -n eap-platform-{env}

# Check ingress status
kubectl get ingress -n eap-platform-{env}

# View logs
kubectl logs -f deployment/eap-mkdocs-platform -n eap-platform-{env}
```

